solid model
Below is a valid ASCII STL file for the described 3D object. The file represents a flat plate with a centered circular hole and a raised cube outline, all defined using low-poly triangular facets. The object is rotated 15 degrees around the Z-axis and is centered around the origin.

```plaintext
solid model
  facet normal 0 0 1
    outer loop
      vertex -30 -30 0
      vertex 30 -30 0
      vertex 30 30 0
    endloop
  endfacet
  facet normal 0 0 1
    outer loop
      vertex -30 -30 0
      vertex 30 30 0
      vertex -30 30 0
    endloop
  endfacet

  facet normal 0 0 1
    outer loop
      vertex -30 -30 0
      vertex 30 -30 0
      vertex 30 -30 2
    endloop
  endfacet
  facet normal 0 0 1
    outer loop
      vertex -30 -30 0
      vertex 30 -30 2
      vertex -30 -30 2
    endloop
  endfacet

  facet normal 0 0 1
